00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:24.640
description mrna vaccines for covid19 vaccines are&nbsp;
substances that protect you from harmful diseases&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:30.960
most vaccines contain parts of weakened or dead&nbsp;
germs that trigger your immune system to fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:38.880
the disease but mrna vaccines for covenanting are&nbsp;
different they contain a substance called mrna&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:42.960
that teaches your cells how to make a&nbsp;
protein that triggers an immune response&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:49.360
in order to understand how these vaccines&nbsp;
work it's important to know what mrna is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:55.680
and how it normally makes proteins your body needs&nbsp;
most cells in your body have a command center&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:03.680
inside them called the nucleus it contains genetic&nbsp;
material called dna that consists of instructions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:10.160
for building and maintaining your body proteins&nbsp;
are one of the building blocks of your body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:15.040
when a new body protein needs to be built&nbsp;
instructions for building it are copied from your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:24.320
cell's dna and converted into a message called&nbsp;
messenger rna or mrna then the mrna travels out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:31.280
of the nucleus to a protein-building machine in&nbsp;
your cell called a ribosome as the ribosome reads&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:38.480
the message from the mrna it builds the protein&nbsp;
your body needs mrna vaccines take advantage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:45.920
of this process to help give you immunity to&nbsp;
coven 19. each vaccine contains special mrna&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:51.360
that provides instructions for your cells to build&nbsp;
a harmless piece of the virus called the spike&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:58.800
protein the spike protein is found on the surface&nbsp;
of the sars cov2 coronavirus that causes covid19&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:05.040
each piece of the mrna from the vaccine&nbsp;
is wrapped in a protective coating

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:10.160
the vaccine is given as a shot in the upper arm

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.840
in the body the mrna particles enter your cells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:20.800
once inside the cell the&nbsp;
mrna travels to a ribosome&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:27.600
using the mrna from the vaccine the ribosome makes&nbsp;
only a piece of the spike protein from the virus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:33.920
after making the piece of the spike protein&nbsp;
your cell destroys the mrna from the vaccine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:40.240
it's important to know that the mrna from the&nbsp;
vaccine never enters the cell's nucleus or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:47.680
changes its dna in any way next your cell presents&nbsp;
the piece of the spike protein on its surface&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:54.800
this allows your immune cells to detect the&nbsp;
protein and recognize that it doesn't belong there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:01.600
as a result your immune cells begin making&nbsp;
antibodies as part of an immune response to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:08.160
the virus in the future if you catch the virus&nbsp;
the antibodies recognize and attach to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:14.720
spike protein pieces on infected cells and the&nbsp;
spike proteins on the virus this marks them for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:22.880
immediate destruction by other immune cells like&nbsp;
all vaccines the benefit of these mrna vaccines is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:28.080
that they give vaccinated people protection from&nbsp;
the virus without having to get sick with covet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:34.640
19. most mrna vaccines for covid19 require&nbsp;
you to get a second shot within a few weeks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:40.880
sometime after getting the vaccine you may have&nbsp;
symptoms such as a fever this is normal it means&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:47.360
the vaccine is working to make you immune to the&nbsp;
virus vaccines protect you your family and your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:52.880
community from diseases that can be dangerous&nbsp;
or even deadly for up-to-date information&nbsp;&nbsp;

